  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Meeting Critical Infrastructure and Technology Needs in the Parliament of Sierra Leone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Delegation of the European Union and the Government of Sierra Leone have identified the need for refurbishment of the Parliament of Sierra Leone (PoSL) building, which is currently in a dilapidated state. The project, implemented by UNOPS, aims to achieve the following deliverables: 1.Provision of new ICT infrastructure 2.Remedial works for all areas damaged by leakage of water (structural and non-structural works) 3.Refurbishment of Toilets and associated plumbing and drainage (sanitation) systems 4.Fire Fighting system 5.Retrofitting electrical system 6.Other stand alone issues&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
